{
  "ALL_TEXT": "115 EXT. ROAD - NIGHT \nVEDA, GOVARDHAN and SULOCHANA are standing dumbfounded. \nTrailing them, a few feet behind, is the BUM. GOVARDHAN \ncleans his hands with hand-sanitizer. \nGOVARDHAN \nAsalemavuthundhi... Aemayyindi \nasalu eeroju... etla accident \nirukkunnaam, etla murder lo \nirukkunnaam, etla dongathanam lo \nirukkunnaam... etla antha easy ga \nclear aipoyi \nintikellipomannaaru...Asalu \nmanakantu ae freedom leda... evado \nirikkichaadu, evado thannaadu, \nevado vellipomantunnadu... \nasalemavuthundi... \nVEDA \nEmo!... Vadilesaaru... adhe chaalu \nnaaku... Evvariki em cheppakunda \ngammuna calm ga life edo chinna \nurlo gadipestha nenu inka... \nSULOCHANA \nMaa Amma cheppinodini pelli \nchesukuni nenu US vellipotha... \nGOVARDHAN \nintiki velagane Aa ANJI gaadu \npaegulu theesi medalo vesukunta.... \nThe two look at him, surprised that he hasn\u2019t changed despite \nthe eventful day. \nGOVARDHAN \nRepu aa aada boss na brain lo spoon \nesukuni thintadhi eeroju \nraaledani... \nGOVARDHAN continues muttering to himself under his breath \nlost in his thoughts. The other two shake their heads. \nGOVARDHAN \nAa police yedavalu kukkalni \nthippuntaaru naa illantha.... Enni \nliterla dettol paduthado... \nGOVARDHAN starts calculating. They are walking on a dimly \nlit, deserted road. SULOCHANA hears a rush of footsteps. She \nlooks at VEDA, who also hears it. GOVARDHAN is still \nmuttering under his breath. SULOCHANA moves closer to VEDA. \nHe turns back and sees some large, shadowy figures walking \ntowards him. No one else on the road. VEDA suddenly picks up \nthe pace and starts running. He pulls SULOCHANA along with \nhim. Both of them sprint. GOVARDHAN is shocked for a second. \nHe turns and sees the men behind him. Afraid, he also turns \nand runs behind VEDA and SULOCHANA. The BUM sees the trio and \nalso runs, seemingly for no reason. \nGOVARDHAN \n(Yelling) \nCheppakunda pargedthaava... \nDrohiiiiiiiiii!!! \nThe men chasing, the Minister\u2019s goons, also start running. \nCUT TO:",
